1110
00:39:33,127 --> 00:39:35,787
The contract says I need to sing "too much rice cake in a burger?"

1111
00:39:36,027 --> 00:39:38,557
It's really in the contract. Check it later.

1112
00:39:39,057 --> 00:39:40,127
It's really in the contract.

1113
