- Where is this? - Go upstairs and check Table 11.

2059
01:14:11,667 --> 01:14:13,897
(There's a complaint about the patty.)

2060
01:14:14,497 --> 01:14:15,667
(She rushes to the 2nd floor.)

2061
01:14:15,667 --> 01:14:16,737
Thank you.

2062
01:14:17,207 --> 01:14:19,837
Let's get ready, Eun Ji. What should we do?

2063
01:14:19,837 --> 01:14:22,277
A song won't cut it for an undercooked patty.

2064
01:14:23,007 --> 01:14:25,017
We need to go and give a full 90-degree bow.

2065
01:14:25,017 --> 01:14:26,777
- We bow and take it off the bill. - We can't joke about this.

2066
01:14:27,717 --> 01:14:30,287
(Young Ji reaches the hall in the meantime.)

2067
01:14:30,547 --> 01:14:31,557
My goodness.

2068
01:14:32,917 --> 01:14:35,557
Is it supposed to be this red?

2069
01:14:36,687 --> 01:14:39,627
Would you be okay if I made a new one for you?

2070
01:14:40,157 --> 01:14:41,797
(Coming up next)

2071
01:14:42,227 --> 01:14:44,497
(We had such fun.)

2072
01:14:44,897 --> 01:14:48,867
(The last day of Space Rice Cake)

2073
01:14:49,467 --> 01:14:51,207
(What's the revived dish on the last day of business?)

2074
01:14:51,577 --> 01:14:55,877
(The long-missed flavors of Goheun are back!)

2075
01:14:57,377 --> 01:14:59,617
(This is my identity.)

2076
01:14:59,747 --> 01:15:00,817
(It's really good.)

2077
01:15:00,817 --> 01:15:03,017
(That's me.)

2078
01:15:03,447 --> 01:15:07,987
(They dream of a happy ending.)

2079
01:15:08,257 --> 01:15:10,757
(I did the math, and you're in the red.)

2080
01:15:11,397 --> 01:15:15,127
(A devastating piece of news comes out of nowhere.)

2081
01:15:15,467 --> 01:15:16,897
(We want more customers to come!)

2082
01:15:17,167 --> 01:15:18,767
(Their final sprint to climb out of the red)

2083
01:15:19,597 --> 01:15:22,207
(They take walk-ins on the fly.)

2084
01:15:22,837 --> 01:15:25,137
(We sell tteokbokki!)

2085
01:15:25,607 --> 01:15:27,707
(While they started out ambitiously,)

2086
01:15:28,747 --> 01:15:31,207
(due to a torrential downpour,)

2087
01:15:31,647 --> 01:15:34,747
(the streets are empty with no customers.)

2088
01:15:35,047 --> 01:15:36,417
(Please come in.)

2089
01:15:36,817 --> 01:15:38,017
(Dizzy)

2090
01:15:38,987 --> 01:15:43,287
(It's deja vu from their first day of business.)

2091
01:15:43,957 --> 01:15:47,557
(An incredible bookend)

2092
01:15:47,897 --> 01:15:50,897
(Will they be unable to turn a profit?)

2093
01:15:51,097 --> 01:15:53,597
(The final sales report)

2094
01:15:54,337 --> 01:15:57,407
(The result of 10 long days of business)

2095
01:15:59,677 --> 01:16:02,177
(A heated dispute erupts over the unbelievable results.)

2096
01:16:02,277 --> 01:16:03,877
(I'll bring my notebook.)

2097
01:16:04,147 --> 01:16:06,217
(From interrogations sparked by suspicion...)

2098
01:16:06,717 --> 01:16:09,787
(to fierce backlash against the HQ's decision)

2099
01:16:10,417 --> 01:16:12,787
(Where did all the hard work of the past 10 days go?)

2100
01:16:13,217 --> 01:16:16,187
(Space Rice Cake is on the brink of running at a loss.)

2101
01:16:16,187 --> 01:16:19,127
(Will they turn things around?)
